    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cornmeal, flour, sugar, baking powder, and salt together in a large bowl. Stir in buttermilk, butter, and egg. Fold blueberries into the batter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spoon batter into the prepared muffin tin.",
